cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or ontology, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "QSAC: Quran Semantic Annotation Corpus"
abstract: >
  A multi-level semantic annotation dataset of all 6,236 Quranic verses
  across 114 surahs. Each verse is paired with its Arabic text, English
  translation (Saheeh International), and 1–5 thematic tags drawn from
  the hierarchical QSAC ontology spanning Islamic theology, jurisprudence,
  ethics, eschatology, history, and more.
authors:
